========================================
SERVICE: INVENTORY SERVICE
========================================

PURPOSE:
Manages product stock and prevents overselling using concurrency control.

----------------------------------------
CORE RESPONSIBILITIES:
----------------------------------------
- Maintain product stock
- Reduce stock on order
- Restore stock on failure (Saga rollback)
- Prevent race conditions

----------------------------------------
FEATURES IMPLEMENTED:
----------------------------------------
- Stock validation
- Stock deduction
- ReentrantLock for concurrency control
- Kafka consumer (order events)
- Saga participation

----------------------------------------
DATABASE:
----------------------------------------

TABLE: inventory
- id
- product_id
- available_quantity

----------------------------------------
SUMMARY:
----------------------------------------
Inventory Service ensures stock consistency using locks
and participates in Saga flow via Kafka events.